evals.prompt:
Next.js Pages Router. `/invite` is a statically optimized page. Push notifications open `/invite?code=ABC123` and users land on the home feed instead of the invite screen. It never reproduces when we click through the app in dev. The page has:

```js
const router = useRouter();
useEffect(() => {
  if (!router.query.code) router.replace('/');
}, []);
```

Give the smallest safe fix and how you would keep it fixed.
